    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nForkin Earls are delighted to present No. 3 Dunbur Terrace to the market, a charming three-bedroom townhouse ideally positioned within one of Wicklow Town's most established and convenient residential locations..\n\nThis inviting home offers bright and well-proportioned accommodation throughout, with a cosy living room providing the perfect space to relax and unwind. Full of warmth and character, the property presents an excellent opportunity for its next owners to modernise and put their own stamp on a home with fantastic potential.\n\nTo the rear, the property enjoys a private south-west facing garden, capturing the afternoon and evening sun and offering an ideal space for outdoor dining, entertaining or simply enjoying the peaceful surroundings. A designated parking space to the rear of the property adds further convenience.\n\nThe location is a real highlight. Situated just a short stroll from Wicklow Town's vibrant Main Street, residents can enjoy an excellent range of cafés, restaurants, shops, supermarkets, schools, sporting facilities, the harbour and beautiful coastal walks. Wicklow Train Station, regular bus services and easy access to the M11 motorway ensure excellent connectivity for commuters travelling to Dublin and beyond.\n\nNo. 3 Dunbur Terrace offers a wonderful opportunity to acquire a property in a highly sought-after location, combining character, convenience and endless potential.\n\nViewing is highly encouraged!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Charming three-bedroom townhouse in a mature and sought-after location.</li><li> Bright, well-proportioned accommodation throughout.</li><li> Fantastic opportunity to modernise and put your own stamp on the property.</li><li> Private south-west facing rear garden.</li><li> Designated parking space to the rear for added convenience.</li><li> Within walking distance of Wicklow Town's Main Street, harbour, schools and excellent local amenities.</ul>"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
